WEBVTT

00:23.060 --> 00:27.046
Driving north on 81, the autumn leaves are

00:27.106 --> 00:32.072
golden red. My family is all around me, trying to

00:32.112 --> 00:37.362
clear my head. We're headed for the parkway Just

00:37.382 --> 00:41.583
a perfect normal day Then we hit the sign at

00:41.743 --> 00:46.064
Lexington The gauntlet's underway The ghost is

00:46.264 --> 00:51.306
in the car again The ghost is in the lane Two blue

00:51.466 --> 00:57.607
shields side by side Her voice is in my brain I-64

00:57.647 --> 01:02.069
the eastbound sign And 81 the north I know the

01:02.249 --> 01:08.213
exits follow But a road is pulling forth This is

01:08.253 --> 01:13.878
the 30 mile gauntlet I'm holding on so tight I'm

01:13.938 --> 01:18.462
trying to be normal I'm trying to win the fight

01:18.542 --> 01:24.007
But every sign is like a cut A reminder of a trap

01:24.267 --> 01:29.312
I'm just a passenger Caught in a ring pre-map

01:35.773 --> 01:39.676
We're getting close to Stanton now The split is

01:39.776 --> 01:46.741
coming fast Exit 221, a test I have to pass Mark

01:46.781 --> 01:52.304
just asked me, are you ready? I look him in the eye

01:52.324 --> 01:57.548
I have to face this demon I'm ready, I will try

01:57.608 --> 02:01.410
We're on the ramp, the turn is made It's time for

02:01.470 --> 02:05.032
Richmond East The world just stops, the light

02:05.072 --> 02:09.353
just fades The monster is unleashed It's her

02:09.433 --> 02:14.035
road, it's her prison It's the place I cannot be

02:14.355 --> 02:19.197
Get me off, get me off She's coming, she's got me

02:43.245 --> 02:48.106
System crash I64

02:50.286 --> 02:59.208
That is not my name System crash She's at the door

03:01.768 --> 03:07.289
She's won the game I can't breathe, I can't see

03:07.350 --> 03:15.372
Get me out, get me free No! No! No! No!

